OL,3,AFlights grounded at major US airports
OL,4,Aafter air traffic control malfunction
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlights have been grounded at major US
OL,7,Fairports after a communications
OL,8,Fmalfunction impacting air traffic
OL,9,Fcontrol
OL,11,FGround stops have been ordered in New
OL,12,FYork City, Boston and Philadelphia, the
OL,13,FFederal Aviation Administration (FAA)
OL,14,Fsays
OL,16,FAccording to US media, the issue is
OL,17,Frelated to frequencies at the
OL,18,FPhiladelphia air traffic control, which
OL,19,Fhandles traffic for airports in the
OL,20,Fnorth-east region
