OL,3,AFlights grounded at major US airports
OL,4,Aafter air traffic control malfunction
OL,5,
OL,6,FDelays are spreading after scores of
OL,7,Fflights were left stranded on runways
OL,8,Fon Monday morning
OL,10,FBoston Logan International Airport has
OL,11,Fwarned travellers to expect disruption
OL,12,Fdue to "equipment issues across the
OL,13,Fnorth-east"
